1
00:00:00,669 --> 00:00:01,996
As Uke takes your wrist

2
00:00:01,997 --> 00:00:03,462
move off center,

3
00:00:03,963 --> 00:00:05,297
about 90°

4
00:00:05,298 --> 00:00:07,633
gripping his wrist with your opposite hand

5
00:00:07,934 --> 00:00:10,928
raise up stepping under the arm
as if raising a bokken

6
00:00:10,929 --> 00:00:13,595
turn the hip sharply
cutting down towards the mat

7
00:00:13,596 --> 00:00:16,763
placing Uke down in front of you.

